1
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,160
This is Jiuri Mountain.

2
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:07,240
It's an important place on the Maritime Silk Road.

3
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,160
Mr. Zhao, you came at the right time.

4
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:09,960
Later,

5
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,600
there will be a wind-praying ceremony here.

6
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,000
I can take some photos for you as a souvenir.

7
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:14,720
No need.

8
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,539
What wind-praying ceremony?

9
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:18,880
Mr. Zhao, this...

10
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:22,410
This way, please. Watch your step.

11
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,520
Mr. Zhao.

12
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,280
Come.

13
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,720
Come, Mr. Zhao, this way please.

14
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,360
This is Jiuri Mountain.

15
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:30,320
Mr. Zhao.

16
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:31,900
What do you mean, Mr. Zhao?

17
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,330
Your zipper isn't even zipped.

18
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,960
Zip it up.

19
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:39,580
Forget it. It's useless even if you zip it up.

20
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,800
What did you say about praying for wind?

21
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:43,560
Well...

22
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,200
Mr. Zhao.

23
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,600
In ancient Quanzhou,

24
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,360
trade mainly relied on monsoons.

25
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:49,880
Officials and civilians all came to Jiuri Mountain to pray for wind,

26
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,410
to bless merchant ships for a safe round trip.

27
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,960
Did I ask you?

28
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,000
Mr. Zhao,

29
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,930
we will go buy you a bottle of water.

30
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:01,960
Let's go.

31
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:05,920
Why buy water?

32
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,930
Buying water. We are spoiling him.

33
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,080
Are the trekking poles ready?

34
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,000
Is the lens ready?

35
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,160
Are you done venting?

36
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,480
I know you are angry.

37
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,640
I am angry too.

38
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,360
But this is our job.

39
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,090
Understand?

40
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,050
I am very professional.

41
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,040
Mr. Zhao.

42
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,200
Mr. Zhao.

43
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,520
I'm sorry about this.

44
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:31,400
Feel free to let us know if you have any requests later.

45
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,720
We will do our best to meet them.

46
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,120
Right, where is the water you bought?

47
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,920
The water is up there.

48
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,760
Ah, the water.

49
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:37,320
There's some just ahead, Mr. Zhao.

50
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,880
You can drink it in a bit.

51
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:39,760
Right.

52
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,890
There's a convenience store up there.

53
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:50,160
How exactly did you plan this route?

54
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:52,520
Does this have anything to do with gourmet food?

55
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,480
Mr. Zhao.

56
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,520
If you feel tired,

57
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,760
maybe you should take a rest.

58
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,960
Sitting or lying down is fine too.

59
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,690
I've been lying down for a year.

60
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,000
You guys lie down.

61
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:08,570
Well.

62
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,480
Mr. Zhao.

63
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,200
Look at you, sweating all over.

64
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,400
Why don't you give me the bag?

65
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,200
Sister.

66
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,160
You are the sister.

67
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,000
Are you jealous?

68
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,600
Have you been jealous lately?

69
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,280
Who's jealous of him?

70
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:29,650
You're never serious all day long.

71
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,800
I haven't even said who it is yet.

72
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,320
Fine, I am a bit concerned.

73
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,180
Concerned about what?

74
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:42,920
Look.

75
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,400
I just... I just can't stand the way

76
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,800
he sucks up to my sister.

77
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:50,280
Acting as a coolie and a yes-man.

78
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,960
What does he want?

79
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:55,560
I don't like him having ideas about my sister.

80
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:58,160
My sister has a house and a car.

81
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,680
What gives him the right?

82
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:01,880
Does he want success without hard work?

83
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:02,680
Impossible.

84
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:06,600
Xinyue, you are really bad at lying.

85
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,560
I do have a tiny bit.

86
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,279
Just a tiny bit?

87
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,079
Just...

88
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,360
a tiny bit.

89
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,880
Since when?

90
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,720
I don't know.

91
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,920
Just assume I fell for his looks.

92
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,080
But...

93
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,360
he feels absolutely nothing for me.

94
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,480
It's not fair.

95
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,360
I'm going to nip this tiny bit

96
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,120
in the bud.

97
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:43,159
How do you know he feels nothing for you?

98
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,340
Just a feeling.

99
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,720
Perhaps with a different state of mind,

100
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:50,250
you see things from a different perspective.

101
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,480
What do you mean?

102
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,600
Nothing.

103
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,920
How about this?

104
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,960
They say out of sight, out of mind.

105
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,440
Keep your distance from him.

106
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,740
If he's smart, he'll leave you alone.

107
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,960
And you'll forget this tiny bit.

108
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,800
Sound good?

109
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,280
This matter,

110
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,440
no third person can know about.

111
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,680
Understood.

112
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,080
No fourth person will know.

113
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,200
You're jealous.

114
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,560
Are you crazy?

115
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,600
I know it all.

116
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,000
Because I'm close to your sister,

117
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,000
you're jealous.

118
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,520
No, I'm not.

119
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,320
You glare at me whenever I talk to your sister.

120
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,360
And you deny it?

121
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:47,960
You've got a sister complex.

122
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,120
You're a pig.

123
00:05:50,320 --> 00:05:52,080
Okay, I'm a pig.

124
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,360
I'll change, all right?

125
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,880
A pig doesn't need to change.

126
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,080
Just stay dumb.

127
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,120
Wait a minute. Why don't you let him rest over there?

128
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,280
Let's take a break here.

129
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:03,280
Are you trying to exhaust yourself?

130
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,620
None of your business.

131
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,720
Hardship

132
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,480
only flows to those who can bear

133
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:15,960
it.

134
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:36,280
It would be great if we could see the night view.

135
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:38,080
But I'm leaving this afternoon.

136
00:06:38,159 --> 00:06:38,960
Mr. Zhao,

137
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,690
would you like to see the photos I just took of you?

138
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,450
This one looks good.

139
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,920
But what's wrong with the composition?

140
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,720
The composition of this one is nice.

141
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,000
I closed my eyes.

142
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,800
The scenery in this one is good.

143
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,360
This portrait...

144
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,760
what is all this?

145
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,920
Mr. Zhao,

146
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,730
it seems you know a lot about photography.

147
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,160
Just a bit.

148
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,600
With a camera,

149
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,640
you just focus,

150
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,700
press the shutter,

151
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,800
and that's it.

152
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,920
Then why are you being so picky?

153
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,160
Come.

154
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,130
Turn around.

155
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:23,770
Turn around.

156
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,410
Turn around.

157
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,280
Smile.

158
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:37,159
Pose.

159
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:53,840
I'm getting a cramp.

160
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,360
I'm getting a cramp too.

161
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,090
I can't hold it anymore.

162
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:02,930
Mr. Zhao,

163
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,920
why aren't you taking the picture?

164
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,400
Come on.

165
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,560
What's the rush?

166
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,720
I'm not ready yet.

167
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,080
I want the right feel.

168
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,410
Give me the feel, got it?

169
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,320
If you wait until everything is ready,

170
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,160
you'll never press the shutter.

171
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,200
Well, Mr. Zhao.

172
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,400
Mr. Zhao.

173
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,720
Mr. Zhao.

174
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:28,560
Mr. Zhao.

175
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,890
Please don't get worked up.

176
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,440
Yes.

177
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,120
Calm down.

178
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,320
This is it.

179
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:45,900
This is the answer I've been looking for.

180
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,200
Alright, I'm going back.

181
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:52,060
Mr. Zhao, we haven't reached the top yet.

182
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:52,920
No need.

183
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:53,930
On this trip,

184
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,960
I have found the answer I wanted.

185
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,360
Mr. Zhao, wait a moment.

186
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,280
Take it.

187
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,000
Mr. Zhao,

188
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,000
this is Shiting green tea.

189
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:13,160
I originally wanted to brew it for you

190
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:15,490
with spring water after reaching the top.

191
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:17,920
I brought a tea set for you.

192
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,480
This is the last stop of your food tour.

193
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,840
All right.

194
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,680
Actually, on this trip,

195
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,660
you've done a pretty good job.

196
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,640
Mr. Zhao,

197
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,770
let me walk you down.

198
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,000
Don't I have legs?

199
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,920
You two

200
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,540
are quite a good match.

201
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,340
Treat her well.

202
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,240
Yours.

203
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,720
I was shopping at a store recently,

204
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,160
and they were having a lucky draw.

205
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,280
So I happened to win this.

206
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:34,180
This order is finally completed.

207
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,930
We need to do a proper review later.

208
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,520
Li Xinyue.

209
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,400
Is there a misunderstanding

210
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,560
between us?

211
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:49,520
This.

212
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:50,480
This.

213
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:53,000
Print this out and send it to him.

214
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,080
It counts as a night view.

215
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:58,220
Our after-sales service is pretty good, right?

216
00:10:58,920 --> 00:10:59,600
It's good.

217
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,260
If you have any work-related questions,

218
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,560
you can ask me.

219
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,200
No need.

220
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,360
It's really pretty.

221
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:36,880
It sure is.
